 <metadata>
  <name>AJ Bell Great Birmingham Run 10K</name>
  <desc>Back in the heart of Birmingham city centre, the AJ Bell Great Birmingham Run 10K route is jam-packed full of iconic landmarks. Starting in Centenary Square, runners will pass some of the city’s most iconic landmarks including the world-famous Jewellery Quarter, Chamberlain Clock, beautiful St Paul’s Square, and highlights such as the Mailbox and Grand Central, before a grandstand finish in Smithfield.

From the start line excitement to the rocking on-course music zones, and an event village that feels more like an after party – the unbeatable atmosphere and local support is uniquely Birmingham.
</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Great Run</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/20495755"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3210950765729614504"/>
 </metadata>
